<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Tips&amp;amp;Tricks on Oliver Weissbarth</title><link>https://www.oweissbarth.de/categories/tipsamptricks/</link><description>Recent content in Tips&amp;amp;Tricks on Oliver Weissbarth</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 27 Mar 2014 15:45:40 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.oweissbarth.de/categories/tipsamptricks/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Build php5.5 with fpm on ubuntu linux</title><link>https://www.oweissbarth.de/building-php-fpm-v5-5-ubuntu-linux/</link><pubDate>Thu, 27 Mar 2014 15:45:40 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.oweissbarth.de/building-php-fpm-v5-5-ubuntu-linux/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;In this article I’m gonna give a quick guide on building and installing php5.5 with FastCGI Process Manager on Linux. I did test it on Ubuntu 12.04 but it should work on nearly any Linux distribution out there.&lt;br&gt;
 &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt; Get the source-code&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;wget http://de2.php.net/distributions/php-5.5.10.tar.bz2 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extract and remove the archive&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;tar xvjf php-5.5.10.tar.bz2&amp;lt;br&amp;gt; rm php-5.5.10.tar.bz2&amp;lt;br&amp;gt; cd php-5.5.10&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;`&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure and create the Makefile&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;./configure --enable-fpm --with-fpm-user&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;www-data --with-fpm-group&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;www-data --with-mysqli --with-mysql --with-openssl --with-curl --with-zlib &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compile the source-code&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;make &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable the default fpm configuration&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo mv /usr/local/etc/php-fpm.conf.default /usr/local/etc/php-fpm.conf &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Copy the php-fpm executable into /etc/init.d/ and set permissions&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo cp sapi/fpm/init.d.php-fpm /etc/init.d/php-fpm&amp;lt;br&amp;gt; sudo chmod &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;755&lt;/span&gt; /etc/init.d/php-fpm &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt; Add php-fpm as a service and start it&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo update-rc.d php-fpm defaults&amp;lt;br&amp;gt; sudo service php5-fpm restart &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have any problems getting this to work or any further questions please leave a comment or mail me.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>